  "worked_solution": "The elements of the given set are the rational numbers that satisfy the equation $|2q|=6.$ So, we first need to solve for $q:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|2q| & =6 \\\\ 2q & =\\pm 6 \\\\ q & =\\pm \\frac{6}{2} \\\\ q & =\\pm 3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solutions are $q=-3$ and $q=3,$ and both of these solutions are rational numbers.\n\nTherefore, we can write the given set as\n\n$$\nA={-3,3}.\n$$",
